|"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| AndroidWorld | **#1** | **100% pass@1** (116/116 tasks) |\n| AppControlBench | **#1** | **99.6% com"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"pletion** (114.5/115 points) |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Read the full benchmark reports, with run evidence and methodology, on our blog. Both used gpt-6-sol"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" with memory and self-improvement off; AppControlBench gives half credit for partial completion."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## See it in action"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Inspect a failure.** The demo catches a cart showing $29 instead of $53, with the failed step and "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"its screenshot side by side."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**See what memory contributed.** Inspect the knowledge supplied to a run and trace it back to the st"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" contributed.** Inspect the knowledge supplied to a run and trace it back to the steps that used it."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Run from your terminal.** Real output from the demo suite: checkout passes; the deliberate cart-to"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"r terminal.** Real output from the demo suite: checkout passes; the deliberate cart-total bug fails."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Get started"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requires Node.js 24+."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Follow the quickstart to connect a model and run the demo, or set up with your coding agent."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> Early stage. Expect bugs. Report an issue when something breaks."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Functional Source License (FSL-1.1-ALv2)."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
